      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.59,
          "en": "So now to finish this map screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.59,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "I now wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 9.183,
          "en": "that we can also tap on this map to select a new place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.5,
          "end": 13.8,
          "en": "Now for that, we need to listen for taps on the map,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.8,
          "end": 16.32,
          "en": "and thankfully that's straightforward,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.32,
          "end": 21.32,
          "en": "because the Google Map widget has a on tap parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.39,
          "end": 23.82,
          "en": "which can be set to a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.82,
          "end": 26.46,
          "en": "that automatically receives the position",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.46,
          "end": 28.5,
          "en": "on which the user tapped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.5,
          "end": 32.523,
          "en": "And that position will be such a lat longitude object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.45,
          "end": 37.23,
          "en": "Now here on the map, I then actually wanna move the marker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.23,
          "end": 40.53,
          "en": "to that position on which the user tapped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.53,
          "end": 42.45,
          "en": "And I of course also wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.45,
          "end": 46.98,
          "en": "that if that save button here in the app bar is tapped,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.98,
          "end": 49.23,
          "en": "so when this function here is triggered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.23,
          "end": 52.53,
          "en": "that this picked location is sent back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.53,
          "end": 54.513,
          "en": "to that add place screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.01,
          "end": 60.36,
          "en": "Now therefore, I'll first of all add a new variable here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.36,
          "end": 64.86,
          "en": "of type lat longitude, which might be null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.86,
          "end": 67.563,
          "en": "which will be my picked location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.7,
          "end": 71.49,
          "en": "And I wanna update this when the map is tapped.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.49,
          "end": 74.935,
          "en": "So here on tap, I'll call set state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.935,
          "end": 77.46000000000001,
          "en": "to also trigger the build method again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.46000000000001,
          "end": 79.56,
          "en": "and set picked location equal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.56,
          "end": 81.513,
          "en": "to that position I'm getting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.535,
          "end": 85.53,
          "en": "Now with that we can also move the marker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.53,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "by going down to that marker.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 90.48,
          "en": "And here the position should not always be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
