          "end": 93.213,
          "en": "to the widget location latitude and longitude.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.092,
          "end": 99.092,
          "en": "Instead, I want to check if picked location is not null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.78,
          "end": 102.45,
          "en": "And if that's the case, I want to set my latitude",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.45,
          "end": 104.913,
          "en": "and longitude to the picked location.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.5,
          "end": 111.18,
          "en": "So therefore, here, I'll check if that is not equal to null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.18,
          "end": 114.99000000000001,
          "en": "in which case I want to set picked location here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.99000000000001,
          "end": 117.24000000000001,
          "en": "as a value here for position.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.24000000000001,
          "end": 119.07,
          "en": "Otherwise, I'll use this manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.07,
          "end": 121.713,
          "en": "constructed latitude/longitude value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.79,
