          "en": "but if it should be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 156.99,
          "end": 159.18,
          "en": "So if picked location should be null here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.18,
          "end": 161.643,
          "en": "you want to use this as a fallback instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162.57,
          "end": 164.25,
          "en": "So that's simply a more concise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.25,
          "end": 166.653,
          "en": "and shorter way of getting the same result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.61,
          "end": 169.50900000000001,
          "en": "But with that, we're moving the marker,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
